sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Asally et al. (2012) PNAS & Yan et al. (2019) Nature Physics osmotic matrix swelling, localized cell-death delamination, and Föppl–von Kármán radial wrinkle spokes in Bacillus subtilis biofilms — MorphoEval overall 93.6/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2013-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling.py` (overall weighted score: 93.6/100, up from 56.2/100 in v1). The remediated script relaxes a 2D circular colony Föppl–von Kármán + localized cell-death delamination free-energy functional via pseudo-spectral L-BFGS-B minimization, reproducing the wild-type central concentric ring and N_spokes = 13 outer radial spokes; validates the 7-point agar stiffness sweep E_s in [0.5, 10.0] kPa (r = 1.0000, RMSE = 1.94 um, log-log exponent -0.3338 ± 0.0008 vs -1/3) and 6-point biofilm thickness sweep h in [40, 140] um (r = 1.0000, slope = 0.9999 ± 0.0017); verifies all 5 genetic and artificial mechanical-score controls (WT, Delta eps/tasA flat mutant, FeCl3 cell-death suppression, guided m=6 and m=8 spoke templates); and segments the SHA-256-locked CC BY-SA 3.0 specimen (`bacillus_biofilm_specimen.jpg`, n = 11 colonies, focal N_spokes = 12, mean spoke angle = 30.0 deg, spacing CV = 0.3156). Overall 93.6/100 (faithfulness 93.4, reproducibility 94.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 95, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 93, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling_comparison.png: rendered output of 2013-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling.py at e93f00e, image/png, 692871 B, 2700×1650 px, artifact_sha256 68b793a887248a1043ff93072882c4552ea9070e6af8a2036074f6a15acf9574 (sha256 68b793a887248a1043ff93072882c4552ea9070e6af8a2036074f6a15acf9574), spec_fingerprint 80d4742b3055639fafb02a0909f223313e723e53cf52d4df159742cd92171fba. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 80d4742b3055639fafb02a0909f223313e723e53cf52d4df159742cd92171fba; artifact_sha256: 68b793a887248a1043ff93072882c4552ea9070e6af8a2036074f6a15acf9574; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling/bacillus_biofilm_specimen.jpg=0ab531dfc2ded692..., datasets/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling_reference.json=7d866d4d5136d397..., datasets/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling/paper_citations.bib=ae278450d6851340..., datasets/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling/scout_manifest.json=d546628168a39289...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D circular Föppl–von Kármán delamination solver to a 3D poroelastic osmotic water-transport PDE resolving radial fluid influx from the agar into the expanding biofilm channel network." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.936"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 094 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

